@HostAddress = http://localhost:5226

### 1. Register New User
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "customer1",
  "email": "customer1@gmail.com",
  "password": "Password123@",
  "fullName": "Nguyen Van A",
  "phone": "0987654321",
  "address": "123 Le Loi, Quan 1, TP.HCM",
  "role": "CUSTOMER"
}

### 2. Login
# @name login
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "usernameOrEmail": "customer1",
  "password": "Password123@"
}

### Variable assignment after login:
@accessToken = {{login.response.body.data.accessToken}}
@refreshToken = {{login.response.body.data.refreshToken}}

### 3. Get Active User Sessions (Requires Auth)
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/auth/sessions
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 4. Refresh Token
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/auth/refresh-token
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{{refreshToken}}"
}

### 5. Logout Single Session
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/auth/logout
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{{refreshToken}}"
}

### 5b. User Logout (Requires Auth - Nút Logout trong User)
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/user/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{{refreshToken}}"
}

### 6. Revoke All User Sessions (Requires Auth)
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/auth/revoke-all
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 7. Search & Filter Books (LINQ)
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/book?Keyword=programming&MinPrice=10000&MaxPrice=500000&SortBy=price_asc&Page=1&PageSize=10
Accept: application/json

### 8. Get Public Active Categories
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/category
Accept: application/json

### 9. Get Category Detail
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/category/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Accept: application/json

### 10. Get User Notifications (Requires Auth)
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/notification
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 11. Get User Unread Notifications (Requires Auth)
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/notification/unread
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 12. Admin: Get All Categories
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/admin/categories
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 13. Admin: Create Category
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/admin/categories
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Công Nghệ Thông Tin",
  "description": "Sách về lập trình, phần mềm và trí tuệ nhân tạo"
}

### 14. Admin: Update Category
PUT {{HostAddress}}/api/admin/categories/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Công Nghệ Thông Tin & Phần Mềm",
  "description": "Cập nhật mô tả danh mục",
  "status": true
}

### 15. Admin: Delete Category
DELETE {{HostAddress}}/api/admin/categories/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

